{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t天文台說，一股清勁至強風程度的偏東氣流會在今明兩日影響華南沿岸，該區雲量增多，氣溫略為回升。預料東北季候風會在星期二抵達華南沿岸，本周中期該區氣溫下降及有幾陣雨。季候風會在本周後期稍為緩和，廣東沿岸天色好轉，氣溫回升。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：方潤南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T01:41:06.810424+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T01:09:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T06:17:25.533015+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T01:34:34.479921+00:00","content_hash":"02377476463549088d84f788e3ab99d138860ce2b8db66d8d89f39f7387a5042","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}